---
// Generated by packages/calibration-lab/lab/figures.py from results.json. Do not edit by hand.
interface Props { caption?: boolean }
const { caption = true } = Astro.props;
---

<figure>
  <svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 660 380" role="img" aria-label="Brier score of the probe against number of embedding dimensions.">
    <line x1="102.92" y1="30" x2="102.92" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="102.92" y="352" class="tick mid">16</text>
    <line x1="200.46" y1="30" x2="200.46" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="200.46" y="352" class="tick mid">32</text>
    <line x1="298.0" y1="30" x2="298.0" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="298.0" y="352" class="tick mid">64</text>
    <line x1="395.54" y1="30" x2="395.54" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="395.54" y="352" class="tick mid">128</text>
    <line x1="493.08" y1="30" x2="493.08" y2="332" class="grid" />
    <text x="493.08" y="352" class="tick mid">256</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="331.14" x2="530" y2="331.14" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="335.14" class="tick end">0.122</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="257.88" x2="530" y2="257.88" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="261.88" class="tick end">0.139</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="180.32" x2="530" y2="180.32" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="184.32" class="tick end">0.157</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="107.07" x2="530" y2="107.07" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="111.07" class="tick end">0.174</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="29.51" x2="530" y2="29.51" class="grid" />
    <text x="56" y="33.510000000000005" class="tick end">0.192</text>
    <line x1="66" y1="332" x2="530" y2="332" class="axis" />
    <line x1="66" y1="30" x2="66" y2="332" class="axis" />
    <text x="298.0" y="372" class="label mid">embedding dimensions kept</text>
    <text x="14" y="181.0" class="label mid" transform="rotate(-90 14 181.0)">Brier after Platt (lower is better)</text>
    <path class="series" d="M102.92 69.37 L200.46 136.61 L298.0 172.7 L395.54 218.07 L493.08 257.11" stroke="var(--viz-amber)" stroke-width="2" opacity="0.9" />
    <circle cx="102.92" cy="69.37" r="4.5" fill="var(--viz-amber)" stroke="var(--bg)" stroke-width="2"><title>16 dims: Brier 0.1827, AUC 0.789, ECE 0.039</title></circle>
    <circle cx="200.46" cy="136.61" r="4.5" fill="var(--viz-amber)" stroke="var(--bg)" stroke-width="2"><title>32 dims: Brier 0.1671, AUC 0.818, ECE 0.039</title></circle>
    <circle cx="298.0" cy="172.7" r="4.5" fill="var(--viz-amber)" stroke="var(--bg)" stroke-width="2"><title>64 dims: Brier 0.1588, AUC 0.836, ECE 0.036</title></circle>
    <circle cx="395.54" cy="218.07" r="4.5" fill="var(--viz-amber)" stroke="var(--bg)" stroke-width="2"><title>128 dims: Brier 0.1482, AUC 0.857, ECE 0.024</title></circle>
    <circle cx="493.08" cy="257.11" r="4.5" fill="var(--viz-amber)" stroke="var(--bg)" stroke-width="2"><title>256 dims: Brier 0.1392, AUC 0.874, ECE 0.017</title></circle>
    <line x1="542" y1="38" x2="556" y2="38" stroke="var(--viz-amber)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    <text x="542" y="56" class="key">probe</text>
    <text x="542" y="70" class="note">logistic head</text>
    <path class="ref" d="M66.0 304.38 L530.0 304.38" />
    <line x1="542" y1="80" x2="556" y2="80" stroke="var(--text-muted)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
    <text x="542" y="98" class="key">oracle</text>
    <text x="542" y="112" class="note">Brier 0.128</text>
  </svg>
  {caption && <figcaption>Truncating the embedding and re-normalising, the way a Matryoshka model is meant to be shortened. Every dimension dropped costs information, which no calibration map can buy back.</figcaption>}
</figure>

<style>
  .fig { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 1.6rem auto 0.6rem; }
  .fig text { font-family: var(--font-jetbrains); fill: var(--text-dim); }
  .fig .tick { font-size: 12px; }
  .fig .label { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .mid { text-anchor: middle; }
  .fig .end { text-anchor: end; }
  .fig .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .fig .axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .fig .ref { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; fill: none; }
  .fig .series { fill: none; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .fig .key { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig .note { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig .big { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-jetbrains);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
